# landmark (assets/world3d/wheelwright/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Square-Wheel Works: the workshop with its chimney, and the house speciality, one great square wheel, raised on a pole.
# Hand-placed by the landmark pass on the room's blocked back band and what lies behind it,
# so it never stands on a tile a knight walks or hides the floor from the camera.

# the workshop
box    wood    at 140 0 -6 size 100 34 26 id lm-workshop
gable  slate   at 140 34 -6 size 108 20 32
box    brick   at 176 42 -12 size 12 26 12
# the square wheel on its pole: rim, spokes and hub
